   "en": "timeline groups counted deals by announcement month (the announced date, not when money moved or when the deal was added here), every month from the first deal to the build month, cumulative_usd running on the same counting rule as total_usd. Cancelled deals and guarantees are left out.",
   "zh": "timeline 按公告月份（announced 日期，而非付款或收录时间）汇总已计入的交易，从最早一笔到构建当月逐月列出，cumulative_usd 为累计值，口径与 total_usd 一致。已取消的交易与担保不计入。"
